// Minimal scintillator used only to introduce GPS, sensitive-volume scoring
// and ROOT output.  GRID10B is introduced in Lesson 04.
:volu world BOX 400 400 400 G4_AIR
:vis world OFF
:volu scintillator(S) BOX 20 20 20 G4_PLASTIC_SC_VINYLTOLUENE
:color scintillator(S) 0.1 0.7 0.2
:rotm r000 0 0 0
:place scintillator(S) 1 world r000 0 0 0
